name=The Zims [ML]
id=TheZims
description=A Sims-style pie menu for Project Zomboid. Right-click the world and the options fan out around your survivor's 3D head as rounded buttons instead of stacking in a list. The head turns toward whatever you point at. Submenus swap in place with the option you came from in the middle. Colours, sounds and size are yours to set, with a live preview. It re-skins the menu the game already builds, so options added by other mods appear automatically. Client-side only.
